1
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,700
Umer: Assalam o Alaikum dosto! Main hoon Umer.

2
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:18,500
Umer: Ab Travel Splash ke Episode 1 mein khush aamdeed!

3
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,300
Driver: Walaikum Assalam, Umer bhai! Saman mujhe de dein.

4
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,100
Umer: Shukriya chacha!

5
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,500
Umer: Aaj ka safar — Karachi se Islamabad. Chalo, airport chalte hain!

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,400
Umer: Dekhiye dosto, Karachi ki sarkon par subah ka rush!

7
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,600
Umer: Airport bas thori hi door hai.

8
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:51,800
Driver: Allah Hafiz Umer bhai, safar mubarak!

9
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:53,200
Umer: Allah Hafiz chacha, shukriya!

10
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:55,000
Umer: Chalein dosto — check-in karte hain.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,800
Agent: Assalam o Alaikum! Aap ka CNIC aur ticket, please.

12
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,400
Agent: Yeh rahi aap ki boarding pass. Safar mubarak!

13
00:01:03,400 --> 00:01:05,000
Umer: Bohat shukriya!

14
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,400
Umer: Camera tray mein — security check zaroori hai.

15
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:16,600
Umer: Camera wapas mil gaya! Ab gate ki taraf.

16
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:20,200
Umer: Boarding ho gayi — ab runway ki taraf!

17
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Umer: Takeoff... Bismillah!

18
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:42,200
Umer: Dekhiye dosto — baadalon ke upar kya nazara hai!

19
00:01:44,900 --> 00:01:47,200
Umer: Karachi peeche reh gaya — Islamabad ab zyada door nahi.

20
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,600
Umer: Thori der mein landing hogi, InshaAllah!

21
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,200
Umer: Islamabad aa gaya! Peeche Margalla Hills dekhiye.

22
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:57,200
Umer: Smooth landing — Alhamdulillah!

23
00:01:59,100 --> 00:02:02,900
Umer: Islamabad ki sarkein — saaf, hari bhari, aur peeche Margalla!

24
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:08,600
Umer: Aur yeh hai Faisal Masjid... SubhanAllah.

25
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:18,100
Umer: Dosto, Karachi se Islamabad ka safar mukammal hua!

26
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:20,900
Umer: Video pasand aaye to like, share aur subscribe zaroor karein.

27
00:02:20,900 --> 00:02:23,400
Umer: Agli episode mein milte hain — Allah Hafiz!
